<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.10.8">
<l>nāṉētu muṉmāya moṉṟa ṟiyēṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">namaṉtamar paṟṟina lintiṭ ṭinta</l>
<l>ūṉē pukēyeṉ ṟumōtum pōtu</l>
<l rend="indent">aṅkētum nāṉuṉṉai niṉaikka māṭṭēṉ</l>
<l>vāṉēy vāṉavar taṅka ḷīcā</l>
<l rend="indent">maturaip piṟanta māmāya ṉēyeṉ</l>
<l>āṉāy nīyeṉṉaik kākka vēṇṭum</l>
<l rend="indent">araṅkat taravaṇaip paḷḷi yāṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>I know nothing of your mysteries.</l>
<l>When Yama’s attendants grab and afflict [me],</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] Strike [me] saying, “Enter this flesh!”</l>
<l>I will be unable to think about you at all.</l>
<l>Lord of the celestials fit for heaven!</l>
<l rend="indent">Great Māyaṉ born in Mathura!</l>
<l>My Elephant! You must protect me,</l>
<l rend="indent">Sleeper on the serpent bed in Araṅkam.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
